infographic hierarchy-tree-curved-line-rounded-rect-node
data
  root
    label One root cause: untrusted input steers a trusted server op
    children
      - label SSRF — user supplies the URL your server fetches
        children
          - label Weaponizes: webhook / image proxy / link preview reaches 169.254.169.254 -> IAM creds
          - label Fix: resolve once, reject internal IPs, pin that IP, kill redirects
      - label ReDoS — user supplies a string for a backtracking regex
        children
          - label Weaponizes: catastrophic backtracking pins the single event loop at 100%
          - label Fix: cap input length, rewrite unambiguous, use RE2 (linear time)
      - label Path traversal — user supplies the filename
        children
          - label Weaponizes: path.join normalizes ../ and escapes the base dir
          - label Fix: path.resolve then assert it stays under base + path.sep
theme
  palette #f43f5e #6366f1 #14b8a6
